01:59:40.719 --> 01:59:44.960
for example there are constants like pi

01:59:43.360 --> 01:59:47.280
which is 3.14

01:59:44.960 --> 01:59:48.880
and we can have our arduino pins as

01:59:47.280 --> 01:59:50.239
